        "id": 1149894
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-08T14:52:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This API only returns the state of the discovery process, and Realtek seems to only supply this information for SOP (see GET_RTK_STATUS).\n\nFor SOP PRIME, I infer the state of discovery using GET_CABLE_PROPERTY. If the cable is \u0027Active\u0027 and it \u0027Supports Mode\u0027, then I say discovery is complete, else it failed.\n\nDepending on the message type, the subsystem determines which command to send.",
      "parentUuid": "9189288f_53818bdf",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 820,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 820,
        "endChar": 70
      },
